# Pull request policy

- **Never merge pull requests.** Do not call merge APIs, enable GitHub auto-merge, approve your own PR, or mark a draft PR ready for review unless the user explicitly requests it.
- **Always open draft PRs** for human review before anything lands on the default branch.
- After pushing and opening/updating the PR, **stop**. The human reviewer merges when ready.

See `AGENTS.md` for repo-specific commands and playbooks.
